 1. WHAT IS FLASH LEARNING?
----------------------------------------------------------------

Flash Learning is an online peer-to-peer tutoring platform
built for university and high school students in Cameroon.
It connects students who need academic help with qualified
tutors who can teach them  either online or in person on
campus. Payments are made via Mobile Money (MTN MoMo or
Orange Money).


----------------------------------------------------------------
 2. TECHNOLOGIES USED
----------------------------------------------------------------

  FRONTEND
    Language   : HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (vanilla  no framework)
    UI Library : Bootstrap 5.3 (grid, components, utilities)
    Icons      : Font Awesome 6 (all icons across the site)
