 3. THE THREE USER ROLES
----------------------------------------------------------------

  STUDENT
    Signs up, sets up profile, browses tutors, books sessions,
    accesses study materials, chats with tutors, contacts admin.
    Pays for sessions through Mobile Money.

  TUTOR
    Signs up, fills in profile (qualification, subjects, bio,
    photo), waits for admin approval. Once approved, students
    can book sessions. Tutors upload study materials, manage
    their schedule, view earnings, and contact admin.

  ADMIN
    Single hardcoded account (not in the database):
      Email    : admin@flashlearn.edu
      Password : Admin@FL2026
    Approves tutors, manages all users, monitors sessions,
    views revenue, sends broadcasts, reads complaints.


----------------------------------------------------------------
 4. HOW A STUDENT USES THE SITE
----------------------------------------------------------------

  1.  Goes to index.html (splash page)  clicks Sign Up
  2.  Fills in name, email, password, selects "Student" role
  3.  Gets redirected to dashboard-student.html
  4.  Sets up profile  date of birth, optional photo, and
      subjects they need help with
  5.  Overview shows recommended tutors based on subjects
  6.  To book a session:
        - Clicks "Book Session" in the sidebar
        - Searches for a tutor by name or subject
        - Selects a tutor (approved ones are bookable)
        - Fills in subject, date, time, mode (online/onsite)
        - If online: selects platform (Zoom, Meet, WhatsApp,
          Telegram)
        - If onsite: enters meeting spot + optional map view
        - Chooses payment method (MTN MoMo or Orange Money)
        - Enters phone number  confirmation popup  pay
        - Booking confirmed with full receipt shown
  7.  Session appears in "My Sessions" as "pending" until
      the tutor confirms it
  8.  Student receives browser notification + email on
      session status changes
  9.  Study notes and past papers in "Study Notes" / "Q&A Bank"
  10. Messages any tutor via "Messages" section
  11. Contacts admin via "Contact Admin" section
  12. Views admin announcements in "Contact Admin" section


----------------------------------------------------------------
 5. HOW A TUTOR USES THE SITE
----------------------------------------------------------------

  1.  Goes to index.html  Sign Up  selects "Tutor" role
  2.  Gets redirected to dashboard-tutor.html
  3.  A basic profile is auto-created immediately (visible
      for messaging even before admin approval)
  4.  Fills in full profile:
        - Date of birth
        - Qualification (Certificate / Diploma / Bachelor /
          Master / PhD)
        - Subjects they teach
        - Bio and optional photo
  5.  Hourly rate set automatically by qualification:

        Certificate    3,000 XAF/hr
        Diploma        4,000 XAF/hr
        Bachelor       5,000 XAF/hr
        Master         7,000 XAF/hr
        PhD           10,000 XAF/hr

  6.  Admin must approve before students can book them
  7.  When a student books, it appears in "My Schedule"
      as "pending"  tutor updates to confirmed/completed
  8.  Tutor receives browser notification + email on booking
  9.  Uploads PDF study materials (notes, past papers,
      exercises) for students
  10. Views earnings in "My Earnings":
        - Gross amount, 15% fee deducted, 85% net earnings
  11. Contacts admin via "Contact Admin" section
  12. Views admin announcements in "Contact Admin" section


