 7. THE PAYMENT SYSTEM
----------------------------------------------------------------

  When a student books a session and pays (e.g. 5,000 XAF):

    Full amount paid by student    5,000 XAF
    Platform fee (15%)               750 XAF  (to admin)
    Tutor receives (85%)           4,250 XAF

  - Split calculated and stored in the database at booking
  - Tutors see net earnings in "My Earnings" dashboard
  - Admin sees total platform revenue in "Revenue" section
  - Payment is simulated (MTN MoMo / Orange Money UI shown)
  - Full details in terms.html (Terms of Use)


