 9. THE API (BACKEND  /api/ folder)
----------------------------------------------------------------

  File                  Method   What it does
  --------------------  -------  ------------------------------
  login.php             POST     Checks credentials, returns
                                 user object. Checks hardcoded
                                 admin first, then DB users
                                 with password_verify()

  signup.php            POST     Creates new user account.
                                 Auto-creates basic tutor
                                 profile if role is tutor

  tutors.php            GET      Returns tutor list:
                                 ?all=1  all tutors (admin)
                                 ?chat=1  all for messaging
                                 default  approved first

  profile.php           GET/POST Gets or saves tutor profile.
                                 Supports multipart (photo
                                 upload). Admin can approve
                                 or set rate via JSON POST

  student_profile.php   GET/POST Gets or saves student profile.
                                 Supports photo upload

  sessions.php          GET/POST GET: filter by student_id,
                                 tutor_id, or all.
                                 POST action=book: creates
                                 session, calculates fee split,
                                 emails tutor.
                                 POST action=update_status:
                                 updates status, emails student

  materials.php         GET/POST GET: list all materials.
                                 POST: upload PDF or delete

  messages.php          GET/POST GET: conversation between two
                                 users, or all convos for user,
                                 or all messages (admin).
                                 POST: send or delete message

  users.php             GET/POST GET: all users with photos
                                 (joins student/tutor profiles).
                                 POST action=delete: remove user

  earnings.php          GET      ?tutor_id=X  tutor breakdown.
                                 ?admin=1  platform revenue
                                 and per-tutor breakdown

  stats.php             GET      Live counts: students, tutors,
                                 sessions, distinct subjects

  contact.php           GET/POST GET: all contact messages.
                                 POST action=send: save message,
                                 email admin.
                                 POST action=mark_read/delete/
                                 mark_all_read

  broadcast.php         GET/POST GET: all broadcasts (filter
                                 by role).
                                 POST action=send: save and
                                 email all matching users.
                                 POST action=delete

  notify_email.php      (helper) Email templates  not a
                                 public endpoint. Required by
                                 sessions.php, contact.php,
                                 broadcast.php. Uses PHP mail()


