 12. NOTIFICATIONS SYSTEM
----------------------------------------------------------------

  BROWSER NOTIFICATIONS (Web Push API)
    - Requires HTTPS and user permission
    - Service worker registered via notify.js on dashboard load
    - Permission requested automatically when dashboard opens
    - Triggers:
        Student books session  tutor gets browser notification
        Session status changes  student gets notification
        Admin sends broadcast  all users get notification
        New chat message arrives  receiver gets notification

  EMAIL NOTIFICATIONS (PHP mail())
    - Sent automatically by the backend on key events
    - Uses notify_email.php helper with HTML email templates
    - Triggers:
        Session booked  email sent to tutor
        Session status updated  email sent to student
        Contact form submitted  email sent to admin
        Broadcast sent  email sent to all matching users
    - From address: noreply@flashlearning.atwebpages.com
    - Reply-to: support@flashlearn.edu


