 13. PDF SECURITY
----------------------------------------------------------------

  PDFs are displayed inside iframes  not as direct links.

  STEP 1  iframe display (not a download link)
    <iframe src="" oncontextmenu="return false;"></iframe>

  STEP 2  URL hash parameters hide browser toolbar
    viewer.src = file + "#toolbar=0&navpanes=0&scrollbar=0"
    #toolbar=0    hides download/print buttons
    #navpanes=0   hides navigation panel
    #scrollbar=0  hides scrollbar UI

  STEP 3  Right-click disabled
    oncontextmenu="return false;"

  STEP 4  No download buttons in the UI
    Buttons say "View" or "View Only"  never "Download"

  Applied in: questions.html, solutions.html,
              dashboard-student.html (Notes + Q&A sections)

  LIMITATION: A determined user can still find the URL via
  browser DevTools. True protection requires serving PDFs
  through a PHP authentication script.


