 19. IMPORTANT NOTES
----------------------------------------------------------------

  - Admin account is hardcoded  not in the database.
    Checked directly in login.php against ADMIN_EMAIL and
    ADMIN_PASSWORD constants defined in config.php.

  - Tutor profiles are auto-created on signup so new tutors
    are immediately visible for messaging, even before admin
    approval. Unapproved tutors show "Pending Approval" badge
    and cannot be booked.

  - Session authentication uses sessionStorage  logging out
    or closing the browser clears the login session.

  - All uploaded files (photos, PDFs) go into /image/ folder.

  - The 15% platform fee is calculated and stored at the
    moment of booking  not recalculated later.

  - Dark mode was removed. The site is light mode only.
    theme.js and theme.css are kept as empty placeholders
    since all pages reference them.

  - sw.js (Service Worker) must be at the root of the site
    for browser notifications to work. It cannot be inside
    a subfolder.

  - To switch between local (XAMPP) and live (AwardSpace),
    change the fallback credentials in api/config.php.
    The file uses getenv() so Railway/AwardSpace env vars
    take priority automatically.

